[1.5] Buyer email generated (ProposalBio framework table included)
[1.6] Airtable record created with full opportunity details
[1.7] CURRENT_SESSION_STATE.md updated → Active Bids table
[1.8] Stage 1 complete → Advance to Stage 2
```

