## STAGE 4: DEVELOPMENT

**Trigger:** Stage 3 complete (resources secured, pricing calculated)

**Purpose:** Write, assemble, and finalize the complete proposal

**Steps:**
```
[4.1] Compliance Matrix Finalization
      File: COMPLIANCE_MATRIX.md
      ├── Requirement 1: [Sol text] | COMPLIANT | [How DDI meets]
      ├── Requirement 2: [Sol text] | COMPLIANT | [How DDI meets]
      └── ... One row per solicitation requirement

[4.2] Technical Approach Writing (ProposalBio Applied)
      ├── Mirror buyer language from solicitation
      ├── Include win strategy themes from Stage 2
      ├── Story arcs: Challenge → Solution → Result
      ├── Sensory language: specific numbers, locations
      └── Agency name frequency: 3+ times per section

[4.3] Past Performance Documentation
      ├── Relevant contract references
      ├── CPARS ratings (if available)
      ├── Commercial references (if allowed)
      └── Format per solicitation requirements

[4.4] Pricing Table Finalization
      ├── CLINs/line items match solicitation exactly
      ├── Unit prices calculated from Stage 3
      ├── Extended totals accurate
      └── Math check: All calculations verified

[4.5] Forms & Certifications
      ├── SF-1449 (if required)
      ├── WOSB/EDWOSB representations
      ├── SAM.gov active registration proof
      ├── Past performance questionnaires
      └── Any solicitation-specific forms

[4.6] Full Proposal Assembly
      ├── Table of Contents
      ├── Section 1: Technical Approach
      ├── Section 2: Management Plan
      ├── Section 3: Past Performance
      ├── Section 4: Pricing
      ├── Section 5: Certifications/Forms
      └── Attachments (cap statement, COI, etc.)

[4.7] ProposalBio Review Checklist
      ├── [ ] Mirror Neuron: Tone matches buyer culture
      ├── [ ] Cognitive Ease: 6-8th grade reading level
      ├── [ ] Story Arc: Challenge → Solution → Result present
      ├── [ ] Reciprocity: Smart questions included
      ├── [ ] Yes Stacking: Capabilities mirror RFP bullets
      ├── [ ] Familiarity: Buyer language echoed 50%+
      ├── [ ] Name Recognition: Agency name 3+ times
      ├── [ ] Sensory Language: Concrete details (numbers, locations)
      ├── [ ] Rhythm: Sentence variety
      ├── [ ] Eye Tracking: Scannable layout

[4.8] Pricing Review
      ├── [ ] Math verified: All calculations correct
      ├── [ ] Unit prices match extended totals
      ├── [ ] Margin confirmed: [X]% meets target
      ├── [ ] Competitive positioning: Matches Stage 2 strategy
      └── [ ] No cost/price data in technical sections (FAR compliance)

[4.9] Stage 4 complete → Advance to Stage 5
```

**Status File Updates:**
- WORKFLOW_CHECKLIST.md: Step 8 [✓], Step 9 [✓]
- Airtable: Source Status = "Stage 4: Development Complete — Ready for submission"

