## STAGE 5: SUBMISSION

**Trigger:** Stage 4 complete + Dee approval to submit

**Purpose:** Deliver bid to buyer, confirm receipt, track status

**Steps:**
```
[5.1] Final Formatting
      ├── Convert HTML to PDF (Chrome print-to-PDF)
      ├── Ensure all pages render correctly
      ├── File size check (< SAM.gov limits if electronic)
      └── Naming convention: [Agency]_[Sol#]_[DDI].pdf

[5.2] Submission Method Execution
      ├── IF SAM.gov → Upload through workspace
      ├── IF Email → Send to CO with read receipt
      ├── IF Portal → Upload to agency portal
      ├── IF Mail → Prepare package with tracking
      └── Document: SUBMISSION_CONFIRMATION.md

[5.3] Confirmation Tracking
      ├── Save confirmation email/receipt
      ├── Note tracking number (if applicable)
      ├── Record submission timestamp
      └── Verify: Before deadline? [Yes/No]

[5.4] Post-Submission Follow-Up
      ├── Email CO: "Bid submitted, confirmation attached, questions welcome"
      ├── Set calendar: Follow up in [X] days per solicitation
      └── Update Airtable with submission details

[5.5] Stage 5 complete → Advance to Stage 6 (pending award)
```

