## STAGE 6: AWARD

**Trigger:** Award decision received (win, loss, or pending >90 days)

**Steps:**
```
[6.1] Award Documentation
      ├── Save award notice (if won)
      ├── Save debrief (if offered and lost)
      ├── Document: AWARD_OUTCOME.md
      └── Update Airtable with final status

[6.2] Win Path (if awarded)
      ├── Archive folder: Rename with "-WON" suffix
      ├── Notify: Subs and suppliers
      ├── Begin: Contract kickoff (post-award workflow)
      └── Add to: DDI Past Performance library

[6.3] Loss Path (if not awarded)
      ├── Archive folder: Rename with "-LOST" suffix
      ├── Capture: Lessons learned (why did we lose?)
      ├── Document: POST_MORTEM.md
      └── Add to: Competitive intelligence for future

[6.4] Performance Review
      ├── Review entire workflow: What worked? What didn't?
      ├── Update: NEXUS system improvements needed?
      └── Document insights for future similar bids
```

**Status File Updates:**
- Airtable: Source Status = "Stage 6: Award — [WON/LOST] — Archived"
- CURRENT_SESSION_STATE.md: Moved from Active Bids to Recent Wins/Losses

